        <item>
            <title>0.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:53:38 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dispatch 0.4.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Hovercards.</strong> Rest on an avatar or a site icon to see who it is. Site cards have a Read button that shows just that site's posts.</li>
  <li><strong>Likes are stars.</strong> Just like WordPress.com, with a little celebration when you like something.</li>
  <li><strong>Comment counts</strong> in the Reader, next to the likes.</li>
  <li><strong>X-posts show up once.</strong> A post cross-posted to several P2s you follow no longer repeats.</li>
  <li><strong>Images on private P2s</strong> now load in the reader.</li>
  <li><strong>Tidier comments.</strong> Short comments get short bubbles, and Like and Reply line up with the text.</li>
  <li><strong>Restart</strong> in the ⋯ menu, and the resize grip stays under the list when the reader is open.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
